No.  MC3 is good enough so that you shouldn't worry too much about that
specific attack, and then besides that you just want to be doing the
most overall damage.  Katanas are better than silver sabers, so you're
already using the right combo and you shouldn't really worry about your
weapon situation for the rest of the game.  If you've got enchant
weapon scrolls to burn, I'd use them to enchant my pickaxe once your
main 2 weapons are +7 (and maybe one backup is +6 or so), since you
don't really need them for anything else.



